<title>SINGAPORE: Amtek increases stake in subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Amtek increases stake in subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amtek Engineering Ltd said on Monday it has increased its stake in Amtek Mega Engineering Pte Ltd to 72 percent from 58 percent.</p>
<p>Amtek said it paid Singapore $86,240 for the additional shares in Mega, which is in the business of precision parts machining.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
